## Objective

Implement `eliot-dreamer-implementation-brief` as the **single provider-neutral semantic owner of the Implementation side of ELIOT self-query**. Given one exact validated self-query job, a frozen set of accepted Implementation sources, their Architecture authority references, and a current conformance/evidence snapshot, produce a bounded `ImplementationBriefCandidate` that states:

